{"4005550": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Fokkland", "steam_appid": 4005550, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4005550/extras/7ebdd3ac455a4b9eb5c8b043b0589a3a.avif?t=1763385503\" width=1078 height=544 /></span><strong>Fokkland</strong> is a cozy exploration game.<br>You play as <strong>Mara</strong>, the princess of a tiny realm filled with cute woodland animals. Wander freely, <strong>ride your horse</strong>, invite animals to <strong>follow</strong> you, help your friends… and keep an eye out for <strong>traps</strong>, <strong>goblins</strong>, and <strong>trolls</strong> along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fokkland isn’t only gentle and sweet: <strong>you decide</strong> who Mara truly is.<br>Will you remain a kind princess… or let <strong>a darker side</strong> surface? Your choices shape the mood of the world and how it responds to you.<br><i>Some of Fokkland’s truths are seen only by those who embrace Mara’s true nature.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Playable now (Beta)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free-roam exploration &amp; horseback riding</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Animal companions that can follow you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Light stealth and danger management (traps, goblins, trolls)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Roadmap (community-driven)</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Castle housing</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Quest system</strong> and <strong>combat</strong> (potential additions)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QoL improvements and new secrets to uncover</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Status</strong>: <strong>Beta</strong> — the game will grow with player feedback.<br><strong>Goal</strong>: A relaxing, all-